   "priceMinor": 7000,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Indulge in timeless craftsmanship Handmade in Italy from premium full grain leather this strap delivers classic character with a refined finish. The surface is frosted and lightly greased , giving it a soft, velvety texture reminiscent of nubuck —rich to the touch and full of vintage charm. All straps are 20mm wide and feature Quick Release spring bars for effortless strap changes. Advantages of Full Grain Leather Straps 1. Premium Quality & Durability Full grain is the highest grade of leather — it retains the natural grain and strength of the hide. Ages beautifully, developing a rich patina over time instead of wearing out. 2. Unique Character Each strap has natural variations and grain patterns, making every piece unique . The frosted and greased finish enhances this, adding a soft touch and matte vintage look. 3. Breathable & Comfortable Unlike cheaper leathers or synthetics, full grain leather allows air to circulate. The genuine leather lining adds to wearing comfort, preventing skin irritation and improving fit. 4. Long-Lasting Investment With proper care, full grain leather straps last for years and look better with age. Outperforms “genuine” or bonded leather in both durability and aesthetics. 5. Classic Style Pairs effortlessly with vintage, dress, or tool watches. The subtle nubuck-like feel gives it a laid-back luxury appeal — perfect for both casual and formal settings. 6. Italian Craftsmanship Made in Italy means skilled artisans, high standards, and attention to detail. Reinforced stitching, clean finishing, and consistent quality.",
